{"id":"08-jazg","html":"<section id=\"thanks\" style=\"background:#F5EFE3;color:#1A1D2B;font-family:'Noto Sans SC', 'Noto Sans', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<img src=\"img/img16_lanterns.jpg\" alt=\"A man releasing a red sky lantern by a river, many lanterns in the sky; he says: 无为\" style=\"position:absolute;left:1192px;top:128px;width:600px;height:780px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0px 16px 40px rgba(26,29,43,0.25)\">\n<h2 style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:120px;width:1000px;font-family:'Noto Serif SC', 'Noto Serif', Georgia, serif;font-size:88px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1\"><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǐ\">你</span>，<span style=\"color:#B8322A\">Junyu</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"lǎo\">老</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shī\">师</span>！</h2>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:250px;width:1000px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.5;color:#3E3B47\"><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǐ\">你</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gēn\">跟</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yì\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qǐ\">起</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kuài\">块</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuān\">砖</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kuài\">块</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuān\">砖</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dì\">地</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gài\">盖</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"fáng\">房</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zi\">子</span>。</p>\n\n<svg style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:330px\" width=\"560\" height=\"500\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 500\">\n  <g opacity=\"0.82\">\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"170\" r=\"130\" fill=\"#E2A93B\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"170\" r=\"130\" fill=\"#B8322A\" style=\"mix-blend-mode:multiply\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"330\" r=\"130\" fill=\"#2F7D4F\" style=\"mix-blend-mode:multiply\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"330\" r=\"130\" fill=\"#1A1D2B\" style=\"mix-blend-mode:multiply\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-family=\"Noto Sans SC, Arial\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"172\" y=\"96\">喜欢</text><text x=\"172\" y=\"126\" font-weight=\"400\" font-size=\"22\">人工智能 · 哲学</text>\n    <text x=\"388\" y=\"96\">擅长</text><text x=\"388\" y=\"126\" font-weight=\"400\" font-size=\"22\">工程 · 网球</text>\n    <text x=\"172\" y=\"392\">世界需要</text><text x=\"172\" y=\"420\" font-weight=\"400\" font-size=\"22\">和平 · 新能源</text><text x=\"172\" y=\"446\" font-weight=\"400\" font-size=\"22\">自然 · 安全的AI</text>\n    <text x=\"388\" y=\"392\">赚钱</text><text x=\"388\" y=\"420\" font-weight=\"400\" font-size=\"22\">工程师</text><text x=\"388\" y=\"446\" font-weight=\"400\" font-size=\"22\">网球老师</text>\n  </g>\n  <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"250\" r=\"54\" fill=\"#F5EFE3\"/>\n  <text x=\"280\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Noto Serif, Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#B8322A\">Ikigai</text>\n</svg>\n\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:720px;top:370px;width:420px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1.4\"><b>“<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xué\">学</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bú\">不</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xìng\">兴</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qù\">趣</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"ér\">而</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"tóu\">投</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zī\">资</span>。”</b></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1.4\"><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shuō\">说</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yì\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"mén\">门</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yǔ\">语</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yán\">言</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiù\">就</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiàng\">像</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qù\">去</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiàn\">健</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shēn\">身</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"fáng\">房</span>。</p>\n  <p style=\"font-family:'Noto Serif SC', serif;font-size:56px;font-weight:700;color:#B8322A\"><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"lǎo\">老</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shī\">师</span>！</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:56px;width:1664px;font-size:24px;color:#6E6A62\">08 · <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"mài\">迈</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kè\">克</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"ěr\">尔</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"lù\">路</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiàn\">线</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"tú\">图</span> · <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bā\">八</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gè\">个</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hǎo\">好</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shù\">数</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">字</span>！</p>\n</section>","notes":[{"hz":"<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zuì\">最</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hòu\">后</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǐ\">你</span>，Junyu<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"lǎo\">老</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shī\">师</span>！<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǐ\">你</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gēn\">跟</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yì\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qǐ\">起</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kuài\">块</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuān\">砖</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kuài\">块</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuān\">砖</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dì\">地</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gài\">盖</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"de\">的</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"fáng\">房</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zi\">子</span>。","py":"Zuìhòu, xièxie nǐ, Junyu lǎoshī! Xièxie nǐ gēn wǒ yìqǐ, yí kuài zhuān yí kuài zhuān de gài wǒ de Zhōngwén fángzi.","en":"Finally, thank you, Junyu, for building my Chinese house with me, brick by brick."},{"hz":"<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"men\">们</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"liáo\">聊</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"guò\">过</span>Ikigai：<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xǐ\">喜</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"huan\">欢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shén\">什</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"me\">么</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shàn\">擅</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cháng\">长</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shén\">什</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"me\">么</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">世</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiè\">界</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xū\">需</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yào\">要</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shén\">什</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"me\">么</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shén\">什</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"me\">么</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"néng\">能</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"ràng\">让</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wǒ\">我</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuàn\">赚</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qián\">钱</span>。<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"nǐ\">你</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yě\">也</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shuō\">说</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"guò\">过</span>：<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xué\">学</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bú\">不</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xìng\">兴</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qù\">趣</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"ér\">而</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"tóu\">投</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zī\">资</span>；<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shuō\">说</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yì\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"mén\">门</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yǔ\">语</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yán\">言</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiù\">就</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiàng\">像</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qù\">去</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiàn\">健</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shēn\">身</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"fáng\">房</span>。","py":"Wǒmen liáoguo Ikigai: wǒ xǐhuan shénme, wǒ shàncháng shénme, shìjiè xūyào shénme, shénme néng ràng wǒ zhuànqián. Nǐ yě shuōguo: xué Zhōngwén bú shì xìngqù, ér shì tóuzī; shuō yì mén yǔyán, jiù xiàng qù jiànshēnfáng.","en":"We talked about Ikigai: what I love, what I'm good at, what the world needs, what pays. You also said: learning Chinese is not a hobby but an investment; speaking a language is like going to the gym."},{"hz":"<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhè\">这</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"dì\">第</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bā\">八</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhāng\">张</span>，<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"bā\">八</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">是</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"gè\">个</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"hǎo\">好</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shù\">数</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zì\">字</span>！<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span>！","py":"Zhè shì dì-bā zhāng, bā shì yí ge hǎo shùzì! Xièxie!","en":"This is slide eight, and eight is a lucky number! Thank you!"}],"bullets":["<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xiè\">谢</span>Junyu<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"lǎo\">老</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shī\">师</span>！","<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kuài\">块</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuān\">砖</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yí\">一</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"kuài\">块</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuān\">砖</span>","Ikigai：<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xǐ\">喜</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"huan\">欢</span> · <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shàn\">擅</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"cháng\">长</span> · <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shì\">世</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiè\">界</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xū\">需</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"yào\">要</span> · <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhuàn\">赚</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qián\">钱</span>","<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"xué\">学</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span> = <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"tóu\">投</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zī\">资</span>","<span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shuō\">说</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"zhōng\">中</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"wén\">文</span> = <span class=\"h\" data-p=\"qù\">去</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"jiàn\">健</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"shēn\">身</span><span class=\"h\" data-p=\"fáng\">房</span>"]}